<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SafeFind - 교내 프라이버시 안심 분실물 찾기</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS 로드 -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Google Fonts: Inter & Noto Sans KR -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Lucide Icons -->
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Noto Sans KR', 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #f1f5f9;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #cbd5e1;
            border-radius: 3px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
            background: #94a3b8;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="text-slate-800 antialiased min-h-screen flex flex-col">

    <!-- 상단 내비게이션 바 -->
    <header class="bg-white border-b border-slate-200 sticky top-0 z-30 shadow-sm">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <!-- 로고 -->
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2.5 cursor-pointer" onclick="switchTab('board')">
                <div class="bg-indigo-600 text-white p-2 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
                    <i data-lucide="shield-check" class="w-5 h-5 sm:w-6 sm:h-6"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <span class="font-bold text-lg tracking-tight text-slate-900">SafeFind</span>
                    <span class="hidden md:inline-block text-xs font-medium text-indigo-600 bg-indigo-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full ml-1">익명 채팅 매칭</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 빠른 데모 계정 전환기 (테스트용) -->
            <div class="hidden lg:flex items-center bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 space-x-2">
                <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-500 flex items-center">
                    <i data-lucide="repeat" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mr-1 text-indigo-600"></i> 빠른 체험 전환:
                </span>
                <button onclick="quickSwitchAccount('student1')" id="demo-btn-student1" class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg font-semibold transition">
                    student1 (분실자)
                </button>
                <button onclick="quickSwitchAccount('student2')" id="demo-btn-student2" class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg font-semibold transition">
                    student2 (습득자)
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- 사용자 정보 및 포인트 영역 -->
            <div id="user-header-area" class="flex items-center space-x-2 sm:space-x-3">
                <!-- JS에서 동적 렌더링 -->
            </div>
        </div>
        <!-- 모바일용 빠른 데모 계정 전환 바 -->
        <div class="lg:hidden bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-1.5 flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 text-xs">
            <span class="text-slate-500 font-medium">빠른 체험 전환:</span>
            <button onclick="quickSwitchAccount('student1')" id="demo-btn-m-student1" class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md font-semibold transition">student1 (분실자)</button>
            <button onclick="quickSwitchAccount('student2')" id="demo-btn-m-student2" class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md font-semibold transition">student2 (습득자)</button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- 토스트 알림 컨테이너 -->
    <div id="toast-container" class="fixed bottom-5 right-5 z-50 flex flex-col space-y-2 max-w-sm w-full pointer-events-none px-4 sm:px-0"></div>

    <!-- 메인 컨텐츠 영역 -->
    <main class="flex-grow max-w-6xl w-full mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-6 sm:py-8">
        
        <!-- 비로그인 안내 배너 -->
        <div id="guest-banner" class="hidden mb-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 to-blue-600 rounded-2xl p-6 text-white shadow-md flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div>
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-1">개인정보 노출 없는 1:1 익명 채팅 분실물 센터</h2>
                <p class="text-indigo-100 text-sm">전화번호나 실명 대신 익명 채팅으로 특징을 확인하고, 물건을 찾아준 학생에게 포인트를 지급하세요!</p>
            </div>
            <button onclick="openAuthModal('login')" class="bg-white text-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-50 font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl shadow-sm transition whitespace-nowrap">
                시작하기 / 로그인
            </button>
        </div>

        <!-- 상단 탭 내비게이션 -->
        <div class="flex space-x-1 bg-slate-200/70 p-1.5 rounded-2xl mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            <button onclick="switchTab('board')" id="tab-btn-board" class="tab-btn flex-1 flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5 py-2.5 px-3 rounded-xl text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold transition-all bg-white text-indigo-600 shadow-sm">
                <span>📋 분실물 게시판</span>
            </button>
            <button onclick="switchTab('chats')" id="tab-btn-chats" class="tab-btn flex-1 flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5 py-2.5 px-3 rounded-xl text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold transition-all text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 relative">
                <span>💬 내 익명 채팅방</span>
                <span id="chat-badge-count" class="hidden bg-rose-500 text-white text-[10px] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded-full">0</span>
            </button>
            <button onclick="switchTab('shop')" id="tab-btn-shop" class="tab-btn flex-1 flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5 py-2.5 px-3 rounded-xl text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold transition-all text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900">
                <span>🎁 포인트 보상샵</span>
            </button>
        </div>

        <!-- ==================== 1. 분실물 게시판 탭 ==================== -->
        <section id="tab-board" class="space-y-8">
            
            <!-- AI 스마트 매칭 추천 섹션 -->
            <div class="bg-white border border-indigo-100 rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 shadow-sm">
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2.5">
                        <span class="bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 p-2 rounded-xl">
                            <i data-lucide="sparkles" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                        </span>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base sm:text-lg">AI 키워드 유사도 자동 매칭 추천</h3>
                            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">분실물과 습득물의 장소 및 특징 키워드를 분석해 일치 확률이 높은 물건을 바로 연결해 줍니다.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <button onclick="openRegisterModal()" class="bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl shadow-sm transition flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5 whitespace-nowrap">
                        <i data-lucide="plus" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                        <span>분실/습득물 등록</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
                <div id="ai-matches-list" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                    <!-- JS에서 AI 추천 매칭 카드 렌더링 -->
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 검색 및 필터 바 -->
            <div class="bg-white p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
                <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3">
                    <div class="relative flex-grow">
                        <i data-lucide="search" class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 absolute left-3.5 top-3.5"></i>
                        <input type="text" id="search-input" oninput="renderItemsList()" placeholder="물건 이름, 장소, 특징 키워드 검색 (예: 에어팟, 2층, 쿼카)" 
                            class="w-full pl-10 pr-4 py-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:bg-white transition">
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex gap-2">
                        <select id="filter-type" onchange="renderItemsList()" class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500">
                            <option value="ALL">전체 유형</option>
                            <option value="LOST">분실했어요 (찾는 중)</option>
                            <option value="FOUND">주웠어요 (보관 중)</option>
                        </select>
                        <select id="filter-category" onchange="renderItemsList()" class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500">
                            <option value="ALL">전체 카테고리</option>
                            <option value="전자기기">전자기기</option>
                            <option value="지갑/카드">지갑/카드</option>
                            <option value="책/노트">책/노트</option>
                            <option value="의류/기타">의류/기타</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 전체 물건 목록 그리드 -->
            <div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-800">전체 분실물 / 습득물 목록</h3>
                    <span id="items-count" class="text-sm text-slate-500 font-medium">총 0건</span>
                </div>
                <div id="items-grid" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
                    <!-- JS에서 물건 카드 렌더링 -->
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ==================== 2. 내 익명 채팅방 탭 ==================== -->
        <section id="tab-chats" class="hidden">
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 min-h-[560px]">
                
                <!-- 왼쪽: 참여 중인 채팅방 목록 -->
                <div class="border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-slate-200 flex flex-col bg-slate-50/50">
                    <div class="p-4 border-b border-slate-200 bg-white">
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base flex items-center space-x-2">
                            <i data-lucide="message-square" class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600"></i>
                            <span>참여 중인 익명 채팅</span>
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">상대방에게 내 개인정보가 공개되지 않습니다.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div id="chat-rooms-list" class="divide-y divide-slate-100 overflow-y-auto flex-grow max-h-[240px] md:max-h-[500px]">
                        <!-- JS에서 채팅방 목록 렌더링 -->
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 오른쪽: 활성화된 1:1 채팅창 -->
                <div id="active-chat-panel" class="md:col-span-2 flex flex-col bg-white">
                    <!-- JS에서 선택된 채팅방 내용 렌더링 -->
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ==================== 3. 포인트 보상샵 탭 ==================== -->
        <section id="tab-shop" class="hidden space-y-8">
            <!-- 상단 포인트 현황 배너 -->
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 to-indigo-950 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 text-white shadow-md flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
                <div>
                    <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-indigo-300 bg-indigo-900/50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Reward Program</span>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mt-2">선한 영향력 포인트 보상샵</h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm mt-1">분실물을 찾아주고 채팅방에서 '전달 완료' 시 습득자에게 <strong class="text-amber-300">+50P</strong>가 지급됩니다!</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/15 rounded-2xl p-5 text-center min-w-[180px]">
                    <div class="text-xs text-indigo-200 font-medium">나의 보유 포인트</div>
                    <div id="shop-user-points" class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-amber-400 mt-1">0 P</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 교환 가능 리워드 상품 -->
            <div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-800 mb-4">교환 가능 리워드</h3>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
                    <!-- 상품 1 -->
                    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-indigo-300 transition">
                        <div>
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-100 text-amber-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                                <i data-lucide="cookie" class="w-6 h-6"></i>
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-600 bg-amber-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg">인기</span>
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-900 mt-2">매점 간식 교환권</h4>
                            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">교내 매점에서 2,000원 상당의 간식 및 음료와 교환할 수 있는 모바일 쿠폰입니다.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="font-extrabold text-indigo-600 text-lg">50 P</span>
                            <button onclick="redeemReward('매점 간식 교환권', 50)" class="bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white text-sm font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-xl transition">
                                교환하기
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 상품 2 -->
                    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-indigo-300 transition">
                        <div>
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                                <i data-lucide="award" class="w-6 h-6"></i>
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg">생기부 연계</span>
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-900 mt-2">봉사활동 1시간 인증</h4>
                            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">교내 유실물 찾기 봉사 공로를 인정받아 창의적 체험활동 봉사 1시간이 인증됩니다.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="font-extrabold text-indigo-600 text-lg">100 P</span>
                            <button onclick="redeemReward('봉사활동 1시간 인증', 100)" class="bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white text-sm font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-xl transition">
                                교환하기
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 상품 3 -->
                    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-indigo-300 transition">
                        <div>
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                                <i data-lucide="book-open" class="w-6 h-6"></i>
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg">독서 혜택</span>
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-900 mt-2">도서관 우선 대출권</h4>
                            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">교내 도서관 신착 도서 및 인기 도서를 대기 없이 우선 대출할 수 있는 이용권입니다.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="font-extrabold text-indigo-600 text-lg">30 P</span>
                            <button onclick="redeemReward('도서관 우선 대출권', 30)" class="bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white text-sm font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-xl transition">
                                교환하기
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 내 보유 쿠폰함 -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 shadow-sm">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 mb-4">
                    <i data-lucide="ticket" class="w-5 h-5 text-indigo-600"></i>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-800">내 보유 쿠폰함</h3>
                </div>
                <div id="my-coupons-list" class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                    <!-- JS에서 보유 쿠폰 렌더링 -->
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

    </main>

    <!-- 푸터 -->
    <footer class="bg-white border-t border-slate-200 py-6 mt-12">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 text-center text-xs text-slate-400">
            <p class="font-medium text-slate-500">SafeFind - 인공지능 기초 수행평가 프로젝트</p>
            <p class="mt-1">개인정보 비식별화 · AI 키워드 유사도 매칭 · 1:1 익명 채팅 및 포인트 보상 시스템</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <!-- ==================== 모달 1: 물건 등록 모달 ==================== -->
    <div id="register-modal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/50 backdrop-blur-xs z-40 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl max-w-lg w-full p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xl relative max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto">
            <button onclick="closeRegisterModal()" class="absolute top-5 right-5 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600">
                <i data-lucide="x" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
            </button>

            <div class="mb-5">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">분실물 / 습득물 등록</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">이름이나 연락처는 적지 마세요. 등록 후 1:1 익명 채팅으로 안전하게 대화할 수 있습니다.</p>
            </div>

            <form id="register-form" onsubmit="handleRegisterItem(event)" class="space-y-4">
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 mb-2">등록 유형</label>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                        <label class="cursor-pointer">
                            <input type="radio" name="itemType" value="LOST" class="peer sr-only" checked>
                            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl border-2 border-slate-200 peer-checked:border-rose-500 peer-checked:bg-rose-50/50 transition text-center">
                                <div class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-800 peer-checked:text-rose-600">😥 분실했어요 (찾는 중)</div>
                            </div>
                        </label>
                        <label class="cursor-pointer">
                            <input type="radio" name="itemType" value="FOUND" class="peer sr-only">
                            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl border-2 border-slate-200 peer-checked:border-emerald-500 peer-checked:bg-emerald-50/50 transition text-center">
                                <div class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-800 peer-checked:text-emerald-600">🙌 주웠어요 (+50P 적립)</div>
                            </div>
                        </label>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">카테고리</label>
                        <select id="reg-category" required class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500">
                            <option value="전자기기">전자기기</option>
                            <option value="지갑/카드">지갑/카드</option>
                            <option value="책/노트">책/노트</option>
                            <option value="의류/기타">의류/기타</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div>
